{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此篇因講次說，講下隨聽記之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已如上出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有據相似燈炷之言，亦通名伏、為斷、為初燄者，不善消文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0072001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0072001", "type": "orig", "text": "矢疑失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0072002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0072002", "type": "orig", "text": "題疑錍"}
{"id": null, "n": "0075001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0075001", "type": "orig", "text": "是則疑即是"}
{"id": null, "n": "0075002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0075002", "type": "orig", "text": "明疑門"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076001", "type": "orig", "text": "歡疑歎"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076002", "type": "orig", "text": "囚疑罔"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076003", "type": "orig", "text": "礫疑礙"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079001", "type": "orig", "text": "而通乃"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079002", "type": "orig", "text": "絡疑終更詳"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079003", "type": "orig", "text": "誰疑誑"}
{"id": null, "n": "0079004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0079004", "type": "orig", "text": "遵疑導"}
{"id": null, "n": "0080001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0080001", "type": "orig", "text": "無字更勘"}
{"id": null, "n": "0080002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0080002", "type": "orig", "text": "聘疑逞"}
